<h1>April's Blessings</h1><br/><br/><strong>
<br/>
Violets shyly smile at me<br/>
Through winter weathered grass<br/>
While cool rain pours down<br/>
As if God had spilled His glass<br/>
<br/>
Sown flower seeds sprout with surprise<br/>
Full of great hope in such small leaves<br/>
Songbirds sing of the sweet sorrow<br/>
When Jesus hung between two thieves<br/>
</strong>
